  "text": "proprium.dominica-v-post-pentecosten-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “5th Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "Be propitious to our supplications, O Lord, and graciously receive these oblations of Your servants and handmaids, that what each one offered to the glory of Your name, may profit all to salvation. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen."
    }
  },
